<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/14th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Kırkdilim</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1392</span> · <a href="/centuries/14th-century">14th century</a> · Also known as Battle of Kirkdilim</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Kırkdilim was fought in 1392 in north-central <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anatolia">Anatolia</a> between the forces of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kadi-burhan-al-din">Kadi Burhan al-Din</a>, ruler of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sivas">Sivas</a>, and an Ottoman army of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bayezid-i">Sultan Bayezid I</a>. Kadi Burhan al-Din won, checking Ottoman expansion eastwards for a time. After his death in 1398 Bayezid occupied much of his territory.</p></div>
